  <Docs>
    <summary>Identifies the hardware delegate that runs an inference model.</summary>
    <remarks>The value corresponds to the <c>DELEGATE_*</c> constants in Android's <c>InferenceInput.Params</c>. The <see cref="F:Android.AdServices.OnDevicePersonalization.InferenceInput.Params.DelegateCpu" /> field uses this type. <see cref="M:Android.AdServices.OnDevicePersonalization.InferenceInput.Params.Builder.SetDelegateType(System.Int32)" /> and <see cref="P:Android.AdServices.OnDevicePersonalization.InferenceInput.Params.DelegateType" /> use an integer, and the default is the CPU. See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/OnDevicePersonalization/+/cc93f1e4164d0a4bb76dd277abc221f4eaf32efb/framework/java/android/adservices/ondevicepersonalization/InferenceInput.java#L112">delegate constant</a></format>.</remarks>
